Qwen3.8-27B on TensorFold v0.6.0 (c464617): TENSORFOLD_MEMORY_RESERVE_GIB may be 0 (the stock floor is 2 GiB), and the
stream memory gate of the dense 27B decoder reads the same variable instead of a fixed 2 GiB. With 0 the budget is all of
MemAvailable (reclaimable page cache included). Applies after 0003.

